contentText:
Feel how you want about her, Carrie Underwood wants you to know that she is unbothered.

On Monday (March 2), the American Idol winner-turned-judge shared a simple message for fans of the show who don&#8217;t like her style of judging: &#8220;Boo me. I don’t care,&#8221; the country singer posted to X , tagging the official American Idol account.

